  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EITI core support 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the EITI secretariat in Oslo for three calendar years, 2020-2022, with 4 MNOK annually. Main purpose to support transparency and accountability within the extractives sector.</narrative>
  </description>
